WEBVTT

00:03.427 --> 00:05.217
<b>Before anything else,
allow me to introduce myself.</b>

00:05.257 --> 00:07.017
<b>My name is Subaru Natsuki.</b>

00:07.057 --> 00:09.727
<b>I'm an indestructible
vagabond who also happens</b>

00:09.767 --> 00:11.357
<b>to be a complete idiot.</b>

00:11.397 --> 00:12.767
<b>I'm a real ignoramus.</b>

00:12.807 --> 00:15.477
<b>Despite that, I hope we
get along swimmingly.</b>

00:16.647 --> 00:17.987
<b>[groans]</b>

00:18.027 --> 00:19.237
<b>OK.</b>

00:19.277 --> 00:21.947
<b>We already know
all that, don't we?</b>

00:21.987 --> 00:23.947
<b>Certainly far too
late for introductions.</b>

00:23.987 --> 00:25.237
<b>Huh?</b>

00:27.117 --> 00:29.957
<b>So then what you're saying is
that I've known the two of you</b>

00:29.997 --> 00:31.877
<b>for over a year now already,</b>

00:31.917 --> 00:34.167
<b>but that I've somehow
managed to forget?</b>

00:36.247 --> 00:38.087
<b>But, I mean, yeah,
my hand definitely</b>

00:38.127 --> 00:40.297
<b>didn't look like this when
I left the convenience store,</b>

00:40.337 --> 00:41.587
<b>that's for sure.</b>

00:41.637 --> 00:44.047
<b>[EMILIA] You truly
don't remember anything?</b>

00:44.097 --> 00:48.137
<b>This tower or what
happened in Priestella?</b>

00:48.177 --> 00:51.097
<b>Even about us?</b>

00:51.137 --> 00:53.057
<b>I, uh--</b>

00:53.767 --> 00:55.817
<b>yeah,
that sounds right.</b>

00:57.227 --> 00:59.107
<b>But, hey, come on!</b>

00:59.147 --> 01:01.357
<b>I can see how this
could be upsetting,</b>

01:01.407 --> 01:03.657
<b>but let's just stop and think.</b>

01:03.697 --> 01:06.827
<b>As far as I know, people who
have temporary memory loss</b>

01:06.867 --> 01:09.577
<b>usually tend to revert
to a particular moment.</b>

01:09.617 --> 01:12.537
<b>In the movies, they usually
remember within two hours,</b>

01:12.577 --> 01:14.497
<b>then they're totally
back to normal.</b>

01:14.537 --> 01:16.997
<b>So there's no need
to worry too much, OK?</b>

01:17.047 --> 01:19.257
<b>Sorry, I don't quite
understand what that means.</b>

01:19.297 --> 01:20.257
<b>Oh.</b>

01:20.297 --> 01:21.877
<b>No?</b>

01:21.927 --> 01:26.677
<b>But, at the very least,
I know you're still Subaru,</b>

01:26.717 --> 01:28.927
<b>and that puts me at ease.</b>

01:28.967 --> 01:30.227
<b>Hey!</b>

01:31.057 --> 01:32.057
<b>There.</b>

01:32.097 --> 01:33.517
<b>All cheered up.</b>

01:33.557 --> 01:36.147
<b>Things are far worse for you
than me at the moment,</b>

01:36.187 --> 01:39.027
<b>so I shouldn't be making
such unhappy faces.</b>

01:39.067 --> 01:40.857
<b>I would never have
expected someone so cute</b>

01:40.897 --> 01:42.857
<b>to be so incredibly gallant.</b>

01:42.897 --> 01:44.487
<b>Now, you, Beatrice.</b>

01:44.527 --> 01:46.987
<b>Oh, I can't believe
I have to do this.</b>

01:47.027 --> 01:48.447
<b>[groans]</b>

01:48.487 --> 01:51.077
<b>As per usual, you are such
a troublesome contractor,</b>

01:51.117 --> 01:52.287
<b>I suppose.</b>

01:52.327 --> 01:53.457
<b>[SUBARU]
Contractor?</b>

01:53.497 --> 01:55.077
<b>[sighs]</b>

01:56.167 --> 01:57.957
<b>This utterly
burdensome situation</b>

01:57.997 --> 01:59.247
<b>had better not happen again,</b>

01:59.297 --> 02:01.457
<b>or I will lose
my patience with you.</b>

02:01.507 --> 02:03.127
<b>You understand, I suppose?</b>

02:03.167 --> 02:05.127
<b>[soft chuckle]</b>

02:06.587 --> 02:08.887
<b>I am the one and only
Subaru Natsuki!</b>

02:08.927 --> 02:11.057
<b>I don't have any
idea what's going on,</b>

02:11.097 --> 02:13.517
<b>but I think I'm probably
your friend at least.</b>

02:13.557 --> 02:16.977
<b>I know this is pretty
shameless, but I need a favor.</b>

02:19.977 --> 02:22.277
<b>I want you both to tell
me what your names are.</b>

02:22.317 --> 02:23.567
<b>Oh.</b>

02:25.697 --> 02:27.777
<b>Well, my name is Emilia.</b>

02:27.817 --> 02:29.447
<b>Only Emilia.</b>

02:29.487 --> 02:32.077
<b>And Betty is
the great spirit Beatrice.</b>

02:32.117 --> 02:35.327
<b>You are contracted
to Betty, I suppose.</b>

02:35.367 --> 02:37.497
<b>We meet again, Subaru.</b>

02:37.537 --> 02:38.917
<b>Hmm!</b>

02:39.377 --> 02:42.707
<b>[theme music]</b>

02:42.757 --> 02:50.007
<b>♪ ♪</b>

04:09.677 --> 04:13.257
<b>What kind of stupid
joke is this, Barusu?</b>

04:13.297 --> 04:14.257
<b>Ram.</b>

04:14.297 --> 04:15.807
<b>Wait, Barusu?</b>

04:15.847 --> 04:19.517
<b>It's like you turned my name
into a destruction spell.</b>

04:19.557 --> 04:21.187
<b>Then you're
the older sister of the girl</b>

04:21.227 --> 04:22.767
<b>who was sleeping on the bed?</b>

04:24.187 --> 04:26.897
<b>I know that you've been trying
to help wake your sister up.</b>

04:26.937 --> 04:29.357
<b>Sorry about the bad timing.</b>

04:29.397 --> 04:31.407
<b>But still, to be
honest with you,</b>

04:31.447 --> 04:33.277
<b>I'm kinda at my limit.</b>

04:33.317 --> 04:34.947
<b>Can you save any
gripes you have with me</b>

04:34.987 --> 04:36.407
<b>for when I have my memories?</b>

04:36.447 --> 04:37.997
<b>When you talk like that,</b>

04:38.037 --> 04:40.497
<b>it's hard to believe you've
even lost them to begin with.</b>

04:40.537 --> 04:42.287
<b>You're the same old Barusu.</b>

04:42.327 --> 04:44.417
<b>Hiya, Master.</b>

04:44.457 --> 04:47.957
<b>I'm Shaula, AKA
your most beloved pupil.</b>

04:48.007 --> 04:50.677
<b>And I'm also Keeper
of the Pleiades Watchtower.</b>

04:50.717 --> 04:52.087
<b>Uh, did you say "Master"?</b>

04:52.137 --> 04:53.337
<b>You talking about me?</b>

04:53.387 --> 04:54.387
<b>I swear.</b>

04:54.427 --> 04:55.677
<b>Wow, what a guy.</b>

04:55.717 --> 04:58.347
<b>You must really love
being a problem, huh?</b>

04:58.387 --> 05:00.347
<b>And who are you with
that uncomfortable,</b>

05:00.387 --> 05:02.187
<b>sickly sweet look
on your face?</b>

05:02.227 --> 05:03.807
<b>[MEILI]
I'm Meili.</b>

05:03.857 --> 05:05.817
<b>I'm not sure if when
you lost your memories,</b>

05:05.857 --> 05:07.517
<b>you also lost
your knack for sewing,</b>

05:07.567 --> 05:09.607
<b>but if not,
I'd really love it</b>

05:09.647 --> 05:11.987
<b>if you made me
another stuffed toy.</b>

05:12.027 --> 05:14.367
<b>Oh, you know
my best hidden talent?</b>

05:14.407 --> 05:16.197
<b>Then we must be super friendly.</b>

05:16.237 --> 05:18.747
<b>You must be in a little
sister role, like Beatrice.</b>

05:18.787 --> 05:20.867
<b>Actually, that girl is
an assassin who tried to kill</b>

05:20.907 --> 05:22.667
<b>both you and Betty, I suppose.</b>

05:22.707 --> 05:23.827
<b>[SUBARU]
That's a joke, right?</b>

05:23.877 --> 05:25.207
<b>[giggles]</b>

05:25.247 --> 05:28.627
<b>So there's Ram, Shaula, Meili,</b>

05:28.667 --> 05:31.757
<b>and if we're moving on
with the introductions, then--</b>

05:31.797 --> 05:35.087
<b>Just call me Anastasia
for the time being.</b>

05:35.137 --> 05:39.057
<b>My friend, I think he needs
a little time right now.</b>

05:39.097 --> 05:41.097
<b>Is that all right?</b>

05:41.137 --> 05:42.887
<b>[SUBARU]
Yeah, I guess so.</b>

05:42.937 --> 05:46.267
<b>This did happen out of nowhere,
so it must have been a shock.</b>

05:46.317 --> 05:48.357
<b>I suspect that's not
all there is to it,</b>

05:48.397 --> 05:50.107
<b>given his current situation.</b>

05:50.147 --> 05:53.107
<b>But if it hadn't been
for your shocking confession,</b>

05:53.147 --> 05:55.527
<b>let's just say I would have had
a shocking confession of my own</b>

05:55.567 --> 05:56.487
<b>to make.</b>

05:56.527 --> 05:57.777
<b>Huh?</b>

05:59.077 --> 06:01.367
<b>Well, then, I'll get
started on the preparations</b>

06:01.407 --> 06:02.907
<b>for breakfast.</b>

06:02.957 --> 06:05.917
<b>Miss Emilia, may I send
Barusu to fetch some water?</b>

06:05.957 --> 06:07.537
<b>Huh?</b>

06:07.577 --> 06:10.257
<b>But his memory is still vague,
and he must be overwhelmed.</b>

06:10.297 --> 06:13.547
<b>Maybe we should let
him rest for now.</b>

06:13.587 --> 06:14.547
<b>It's all good.</b>

06:14.587 --> 06:16.007
<b>My body's still fine.</b>

06:16.047 --> 06:17.757
<b>I can handle
a little water run.</b>

06:17.797 --> 06:19.057
<b>Yeah, Emilia?</b>

06:27.187 --> 06:28.517
<b>[sighs]</b>

06:29.187 --> 06:30.607
<b>You seem awfully tired.</b>

06:30.647 --> 06:32.317
<b>Well, can you
really blame me?</b>

06:32.357 --> 06:35.607
<b>Plus, I was never the type
to be so considerate of others.</b>

06:36.817 --> 06:37.987
<b>Enough.</b>

06:38.027 --> 06:40.237
<b>Drop this
ridiculous charade, Barusu.</b>

06:40.277 --> 06:41.697
<b>[SUBARU sighs]</b>

06:41.747 --> 06:43.657
<b>I brought you away
from the others.</b>

06:43.697 --> 06:46.667
<b>Now, don't make a woman
embarrass herself, you lecher.</b>

06:46.707 --> 06:48.127
<b>Now I'm a lecher?</b>

06:48.167 --> 06:50.497
<b>This is just another
stupid whim of yours, right?</b>

06:50.547 --> 06:53.627
<b>I understand that Miss
Emilia can't keep a secret,</b>

06:53.667 --> 06:55.377
<b>but you can at least tell
me what you're plotting</b>

06:55.417 --> 06:57.087
<b>now that we're in private.</b>

06:57.137 --> 07:00.137
<b>Uh, sorry to disappoint you,
but this isn't a plot or an act</b>

07:00.177 --> 07:01.927
<b>or a bad joke or anything.</b>

07:01.967 --> 07:04.597
<b>Stubborn, though bearing
too much of the burden alone</b>

07:04.637 --> 07:05.887
<b>is nothing new for you.</b>

07:05.937 --> 07:07.137
<b>[SUBARU]
Look, I told you--</b>

07:07.187 --> 07:09.107
<b>Stop playing
and tell me everything.</b>

07:09.147 --> 07:11.107
<b>Your secret will
be safe with me.</b>

07:11.147 --> 07:13.317
<b>As enticing as it sounds
to have a little secret</b>

07:13.357 --> 07:14.987
<b>between just the two of us--</b>

07:15.027 --> 07:16.607
<b>[groans]</b>

07:18.947 --> 07:20.657
<b>Hey, what the hell was
that for all of a sudden?</b>

07:20.697 --> 07:22.237
<b>[RAM]
Tell me.</b>

07:22.287 --> 07:24.997
<b>I have some ideas as to what
I'll do if you keep this up.</b>

07:25.037 --> 07:26.747
<b>Wow, you really
haven't been listening.</b>

07:26.787 --> 07:28.247
<b>Like I said,
I'm not lying! I--</b>

07:28.287 --> 07:30.327
<b>Tell me everything right now!</b>

07:31.957 --> 07:34.127
<b>Tell me everything.</b>

07:34.167 --> 07:35.417
<b>I--</b>

07:36.087 --> 07:37.467
<b>[RAM]
I'm begging you.</b>

07:37.507 --> 07:39.507
<b>Tell me everything.</b>

07:39.547 --> 07:41.757
<b>But, Ram.</b>

07:41.807 --> 07:43.307
<b>[RAM]
Please.</b>

07:43.347 --> 07:47.017
<b>If even you forget, then I--</b>

07:48.767 --> 07:50.187
<b>and Rem.</b>

07:53.187 --> 07:54.777
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:57.487 --> 07:58.737
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:01.317 --> 08:02.567
<b>[SHAULA]
Hey, Master!</b>

08:02.617 --> 08:04.487
<b>We're starting to run
out of dried meat!</b>

08:04.527 --> 08:05.447
<b>[SUBARU]
Gotcha.</b>

08:05.487 --> 08:06.947
<b>I'm on it.</b>

08:06.997 --> 08:09.827
<b>You'll only make Miss
Emilia and the others worry.</b>

08:09.867 --> 08:12.037
<b>Don't speak of what
just happened.</b>

08:17.167 --> 08:19.377
<b>I apologize about before.</b>

08:19.427 --> 08:21.587
<b>Is now a good time to talk?</b>

08:21.637 --> 08:22.757
<b>Sure.</b>

08:22.797 --> 08:24.887
<b>And I'm sorry
for the shock, too.</b>

08:24.927 --> 08:27.427
<b>Uh, I'll just listen.</b>

08:27.477 --> 08:30.227
<b>I am Julius Juukulius.</b>

08:30.267 --> 08:34.107
<b>Miss Anastasia's--
this lady's first knight.</b>

08:34.147 --> 08:37.527
<b>You and I are
friends, basically.</b>

08:37.567 --> 08:38.567
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

08:38.607 --> 08:39.857
<b>Nice to know ya.</b>

08:39.897 --> 08:42.527
<b>But why didn't you
sound very sure of that?</b>

08:42.567 --> 08:44.487
<b>I don't think that
you need to worry.</b>

08:44.527 --> 08:46.407
<b>Everyone knows you
and Julius are really</b>

08:46.447 --> 08:47.907
<b>good friends, after all.</b>

08:47.947 --> 08:48.957
<b>Aren't they?</b>

08:48.997 --> 08:50.207
<b>Yeah, they are.</b>

08:50.247 --> 08:51.827
<b>Although Mr. Knight
here looks like</b>

08:51.877 --> 08:53.337
<b>he has something on his mind.</b>

08:53.377 --> 08:56.127
<b>Anything you wanted to tell us?</b>

08:56.167 --> 08:59.217
<b>[RAM] Then is it about Miss
Anastasia's unusual behavior</b>

08:59.257 --> 09:01.677
<b>since this morning?</b>

09:01.717 --> 09:04.137
<b>Exactly that, Miss Ram.</b>

09:04.177 --> 09:07.517
<b>Though I hate to simply tack
it on to Subaru's predicament.</b>

09:07.557 --> 09:08.727
<b>I don't want to just keep</b>

09:08.767 --> 09:10.977
<b>piling on to the
confusion either,</b>

09:11.017 --> 09:12.477
<b>but I'll believe in the bond</b>

09:12.517 --> 09:14.687
<b>we formed fighting
through the dunes together</b>

09:14.727 --> 09:16.357
<b>and tell the full truth.</b>

09:16.397 --> 09:19.107
<b>Well, that's a rather
concerning declaration.</b>

09:19.147 --> 09:21.237
<b>[ANASTASIA] You two
really have the ideal bond.</b>

09:21.277 --> 09:23.777
<b>It's so heartwarming
to witness.</b>

09:23.817 --> 09:25.737
<b>I had hoped to one day
build the same kind</b>

09:25.777 --> 09:27.907
<b>of special
relationship with Ana.</b>

09:27.947 --> 09:32.207
<b>You talk about Miss Anastasia
like she's a different person.</b>

09:32.247 --> 09:33.537
<b>So it's true that you're--</b>

09:33.577 --> 09:34.827
<b>Uh--</b>

09:35.997 --> 09:38.457
<b>Yes, the consciousness
residing in this body</b>

09:38.507 --> 09:39.667
<b>is not hers.</b>

09:39.707 --> 09:41.127
<b>[munches]</b>

09:43.007 --> 09:45.887
<b>She's currently sleeping
deeply inside here.</b>

09:45.927 --> 09:48.677
<b>I'm standing
in for her temporarily.</b>

09:48.717 --> 09:50.807
<b>You may call me Echidna.</b>

09:50.847 --> 09:52.177
<b>Echidna?</b>

09:52.227 --> 09:54.097
<b>[ECHIDNA] Natsuki had
the same reaction.</b>

09:54.137 --> 09:57.147
<b>I suppose that name brings
about certain feelings.</b>

09:57.187 --> 10:01.437
<b>But please know that I'm not
the Echidna you all know.</b>

10:01.487 --> 10:04.737
<b>Oh, sorry if
my reaction was hurtful.</b>

10:04.777 --> 10:06.867
<b>I think it's safe
to say both Subaru</b>

10:06.907 --> 10:09.657
<b>and I were pretty badly
tormented in the past</b>

10:09.697 --> 10:11.367
<b>by someone named Echidna.</b>

10:11.407 --> 10:12.907
<b>So we just happened
to meet someone</b>

10:12.957 --> 10:14.577
<b>else named Echidna, huh?</b>

10:14.617 --> 10:17.337
<b>That other one sure seemed
to have made a mess of things.</b>

10:17.377 --> 10:18.417
<b>She did.</b>

10:18.457 --> 10:20.257
<b>Echidna was a lot of trouble.</b>

10:20.297 --> 10:22.377
<b>We should let her know
if we ever meet again.</b>

10:22.417 --> 10:23.967
<b>I hope that you will.</b>

10:24.007 --> 10:26.637
<b>And given how much she's
managed to harm my reputation,</b>

10:26.677 --> 10:28.597
<b>please speak for me as well.</b>

10:28.637 --> 10:31.557
<b>But the whole reason you
guys all came to this tower</b>

10:31.597 --> 10:33.307
<b>was to help people, right?</b>

10:33.347 --> 10:34.477
<b>So why--</b>

10:34.517 --> 10:35.937
<b>As soon as we
reached the tower</b>

10:35.977 --> 10:37.647
<b>and started making our way up,</b>

10:37.687 --> 10:39.647
<b>the few memories
you had suddenly vanished,</b>

10:39.687 --> 10:41.357
<b>and we learned
Anastasia's consciousness</b>

10:41.397 --> 10:43.317
<b>sleeps in the void.</b>

10:43.357 --> 10:45.947
<b>So straight up not
having a good time.</b>

10:45.987 --> 10:51.997
<b>Um, you know, hey, wallowing
forever won't get us anywhere.</b>

10:52.037 --> 10:53.747
<b>Emilia?</b>

10:53.787 --> 10:57.207
<b>All of us carry the hopes of so
many people on our shoulders.</b>

10:57.247 --> 10:59.247
<b>We have to forge on.</b>

10:59.287 --> 11:01.127
<b>Giving up's not an option.</b>

11:01.167 --> 11:03.167
<b>Someone special taught me that.</b>

11:04.917 --> 11:07.337
<b>Everything Emilia
said is spot on.</b>

11:07.387 --> 11:10.847
<b>I apologize for screwing things
up by losing all my memories,</b>

11:10.887 --> 11:12.847
<b>but our perspective
makes a difference.</b>

11:12.887 --> 11:14.597
<b>Maybe while I'm stuck
in this sorry state,</b>

11:14.637 --> 11:16.387
<b>I can at least come up
with some interesting ideas</b>

11:16.437 --> 11:18.857
<b>that aren't bound
by the rules of this world.</b>

11:18.897 --> 11:21.017
<b>We'll turn this crisis
into our chance!</b>

11:21.057 --> 11:23.027
<b>That certainly is
an optimistic outlook,</b>

11:23.067 --> 11:24.437
<b>to say the very least.</b>

11:24.487 --> 11:27.657
<b>But it's very Subaru,
I suppose.</b>

11:27.697 --> 11:29.617
<b>[EMILIA]
Thank you, Subaru.</b>

11:29.657 --> 11:34.497
<b>I really am so glad you're
still Subaru after all.</b>

11:34.537 --> 11:36.077
<b>Good grief.</b>

11:36.117 --> 11:39.037
<b>Regardless of your memories,
your bravery and reckless</b>

11:39.077 --> 11:41.787
<b>refusal to adhere to a black
and white way of thinking</b>

11:41.837 --> 11:43.207
<b>never change.</b>

11:43.247 --> 11:46.257
<b>But still, I'd like to know
what led you to lose</b>

11:46.297 --> 11:47.677
<b>your memories like that.</b>

11:47.717 --> 11:49.007
<b>The thing is,</b>

11:49.047 --> 11:52.007
<b>I seriously don't
have a clue myself either.</b>

11:52.047 --> 11:54.807
<b>Emilia, how did you guys
find me before I woke up?</b>

11:54.847 --> 11:56.847
<b>Well, we discovered
you passed out</b>

11:56.887 --> 11:59.267
<b>in the third floor archive.</b>

11:59.307 --> 12:01.187
<b>[SUBARU]
The third floor archive?</b>

12:03.357 --> 12:04.897
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:04.937 --> 12:08.397
<b>After that, we carried you
from there to the green room.</b>

12:08.447 --> 12:11.157
<b>So likely the archive,
or something within it,</b>

12:11.197 --> 12:13.327
<b>was in some way responsible.</b>

12:13.367 --> 12:16.537
<b>Well, that place is an archive
full of books of the dead,</b>

12:16.577 --> 12:17.617
<b>after all.</b>

12:17.657 --> 12:19.367
<b>Did you say
books of the dead?</b>

12:19.417 --> 12:20.707
<b>That sounds like
something that would get</b>

12:20.747 --> 12:22.417
<b>a teenage boy's heart racing.</b>

12:22.457 --> 12:24.087
<b>The books of the dead
allow the one reading</b>

12:24.127 --> 12:25.747
<b>to experience
the memories</b>

12:25.797 --> 12:27.667
<b>of those lives vicariously.</b>

12:27.717 --> 12:29.877
<b>Not that I would
want that experience.</b>

12:29.927 --> 12:32.347
<b>So I was reading one
of them and then passed out?</b>

12:32.387 --> 12:35.597
<b>Maybe that fried my brain
and made me lose my memories.</b>

12:35.637 --> 12:37.807
<b>It's not impossible.</b>

12:37.847 --> 12:39.767
<b>I could try to figure
it out in the archive.</b>

12:39.807 --> 12:41.437
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:41.477 --> 12:44.017
<b>Then after breakfast, we'll do
an on the spot investigation.</b>

12:45.147 --> 12:46.687
<b>But at the same time,
we don't want a repeat</b>

12:46.737 --> 12:48.527
<b>of what happened
to you yesterday.</b>

12:48.567 --> 12:50.357
<b>So we'll do the investigating.</b>

12:50.397 --> 12:52.487
<b>You stay here and rest
in the meantime.</b>

12:52.527 --> 12:53.527
<b>I suppose.</b>

12:53.577 --> 12:54.577
<b>Huh?</b>

12:54.617 --> 12:55.947
<b>Huh?</b>

12:58.037 --> 12:59.407
<b>Damn it.</b>

12:59.457 --> 13:01.707
<b>After all that,
I gave in to peer pressure.</b>

13:01.747 --> 13:03.587
<b>Do I not even get a vote?</b>

13:06.127 --> 13:08.007
<b>Status open!</b>

13:09.917 --> 13:11.677
<b>No dice.</b>

13:11.717 --> 13:13.677
<b>If this is a parallel world,
I was looking forward to</b>

13:13.717 --> 13:16.137
<b>at least having magic, but--</b>

13:16.177 --> 13:19.177
<b>You've permanently lost
your ability to ever use it.</b>

13:19.227 --> 13:21.977
<b>You used too much beginner
magic you were told not to use</b>

13:22.017 --> 13:24.687
<b>and broke your gate
beyond repair, I suppose.</b>

13:24.727 --> 13:27.567
<b>What loser breaks their gate
with beginner stuff?</b>

13:27.607 --> 13:29.777
<b>OK, then how about this?</b>

13:29.817 --> 13:30.777
<b>[whip crack, groans]</b>

13:30.817 --> 13:31.987
<b>Ow!</b>

13:32.027 --> 13:33.197
<b>Isn't this the kind of thing</b>

13:33.237 --> 13:35.487
<b>where muscle memory
should take over?</b>

13:35.527 --> 13:37.577
<b>I should have at least
kept a diary of everything</b>

13:37.617 --> 13:39.077
<b>I've done for a time like this.</b>

13:39.117 --> 13:41.117
<b>I'm so useless now.</b>

13:45.077 --> 13:46.377
<b>It'll be OK.</b>

13:46.417 --> 13:47.627
<b>This is going to work.</b>

13:47.667 --> 13:51.087
<b>In this world,
even I should be--</b>

13:51.127 --> 13:52.467
<b>uh, whoops.</b>

13:52.507 --> 13:54.217
<b>It's not this way.</b>

13:54.257 --> 13:55.507
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:00.137 --> 14:01.977
<b>Whoa!</b>

14:02.017 --> 14:03.187
<b>What's with this staircase?</b>

14:03.227 --> 14:05.267
<b>It looks like it
goes on forever.</b>

14:05.307 --> 14:06.897
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:06.937 --> 14:07.397
<b>[yells]</b>

14:08.477 --> 14:11.527
<b>Wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait, wait,</b>

14:11.567 --> 14:13.737
<b>wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!</b>

14:13.777 --> 14:15.367
<b>[thud, crunch]</b>

14:17.027 --> 14:19.367
<b>[EMILIA]
Subaru, are you all right?</b>

14:23.497 --> 14:24.537
<b>Emilia?</b>

14:24.577 --> 14:26.167
<b>How--</b>

14:26.207 --> 14:27.497
<b>[EMILIA]
Oh, what a relief.</b>

14:27.537 --> 14:29.707
<b>I was really worried about you.</b>

14:29.747 --> 14:31.457
<b>[BEATRICE] Emilia,
you need to be firmer with him</b>

14:31.507 --> 14:34.087
<b>or he won't feel bad
about what he's done.</b>

14:34.127 --> 14:35.387
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

14:35.427 --> 14:37.257
<b>Like Beatrice said,
you've been naughty.</b>

14:37.297 --> 14:39.347
<b>She panicked when we
couldn't find you anywhere,</b>

14:39.387 --> 14:40.847
<b>and when we did find
you on the ground,</b>

14:40.887 --> 14:41.887
<b>she almost started crying.</b>

14:41.927 --> 14:43.477
<b>Huh? Hey!</b>

14:43.517 --> 14:45.557
<b>You don't need to share
every little detail about that</b>

14:45.597 --> 14:46.647
<b>with him, I suppose.</b>

14:46.687 --> 14:48.437
<b>Huh?</b>

14:48.477 --> 14:50.187
<b>Is this a dream?</b>

14:50.227 --> 14:51.477
<b>Huh?</b>

14:52.317 --> 14:53.987
<b>[SUBARU]
Huh? What?</b>

14:54.027 --> 14:57.447
<b>Wait, so you mean I passed
out in the archive again?</b>

14:57.487 --> 14:59.027
<b>Again?</b>

14:59.077 --> 15:01.447
<b>No, but you guys all stopped
me from going back the time</b>

15:01.487 --> 15:03.497
<b>after that, so I didn't.</b>

15:03.537 --> 15:05.497
<b>Stopped you?</b>

15:05.537 --> 15:07.207
<b>I'm getting the feeling
we're talking about</b>

15:07.247 --> 15:08.877
<b>two different things here.</b>

15:08.917 --> 15:11.837
<b>Subaru, I want you to try
explaining to Betty in detail</b>

15:11.877 --> 15:13.877
<b>exactly how you got here,
I suppose.</b>

15:13.917 --> 15:15.217
<b>OK.</b>

15:15.257 --> 15:17.467
<b>Well, like I said before,
when I woke up,</b>

15:17.507 --> 15:19.547
<b>I discovered that
my memories had vanished.</b>

15:19.597 --> 15:21.257
<b>- All of my memories--
- Wait, wait, wait, wait--</b>

15:21.297 --> 15:22.217
<b>--since I was
summoned to this world.</b>

15:22.597 --> 15:23.677
<b>Memories?</b>

15:23.727 --> 15:24.847
<b>What's this about
your memories?</b>

15:24.887 --> 15:25.887
<b>[SUBARU]
Huh?</b>

15:25.927 --> 15:26.887
<b>Hold on.</b>

15:26.927 --> 15:28.187
<b>That's what trips you up?</b>

15:28.227 --> 15:30.227
<b>I mean, I already
told you two about--</b>

15:30.267 --> 15:31.517
<b>uh.</b>

15:32.687 --> 15:35.527
<b>I've definitely had this
conversation before.</b>

15:35.567 --> 15:38.237
<b>Was that a prophetic dream?</b>

15:38.277 --> 15:39.617
<b>Subaru?</b>

15:39.657 --> 15:42.077
<b>I need you guys to stay
calm and hear me out.</b>

15:42.117 --> 15:43.907
<b>See, I had a proph--</b>

15:45.117 --> 15:46.497
<b>Huh?</b>

15:46.537 --> 15:48.327
<b>I know what I'm about
to say might be hard</b>

15:48.367 --> 15:49.537
<b>for you to believe,</b>

15:49.577 --> 15:51.457
<b>but it seems like
I've lost my memory,</b>

15:51.497 --> 15:52.457
<b>so that sucks.</b>

15:52.497 --> 15:53.547
<b>[clap]</b>

15:53.587 --> 15:54.587
<b>There.</b>

15:54.627 --> 15:55.797
<b>All cheered up.</b>

15:55.837 --> 15:57.417
<b>Things are far worse
for you than me</b>

15:57.467 --> 15:58.797
<b>at the moment,</b>

15:58.837 --> 16:01.297
<b>so I shouldn't be making
such unhappy faces.</b>

16:01.347 --> 16:02.847
<b>[BEATRICE]
I can't believe this!</b>

16:02.887 --> 16:05.307
<b>As per usual, you are such
a troublesome contractor,</b>

16:05.347 --> 16:06.427
<b>I suppose.</b>

16:06.477 --> 16:08.057
<b>This utterly
burdensome situation</b>

16:08.097 --> 16:09.977
<b>had better not happen again,
or I will lose my patience--</b>

16:10.017 --> 16:12.727
<b>No one seemed to know
about this in my dream either.</b>

16:12.767 --> 16:14.317
<b>I didn't--</b>

16:14.357 --> 16:16.567
<b>the Subaru Natsuki
they know didn't tell them</b>

16:16.607 --> 16:18.237
<b>about this power.</b>

16:18.277 --> 16:19.907
<b>But why, though?</b>

16:19.947 --> 16:23.117
<b>What the hell were you
thinking, Subaru Natsuki?</b>

16:23.157 --> 16:25.327
<b>What kind of stupid
joke is this, Barusu?</b>

16:25.367 --> 16:26.997
<b>[SHAULA]
Hiya, Master.</b>

16:27.037 --> 16:30.207
<b>I'm Shaula, AKA
your most beloved pupil,</b>

16:30.247 --> 16:32.127
<b>and I'm also Keeper
of the Pleiades Watchtower.</b>

16:32.167 --> 16:33.127
<b>[MEILI]
I swear.</b>

16:33.167 --> 16:34.377
<b>Wow, what a guy.</b>

16:34.417 --> 16:35.997
<b>You must really love
being a problem, huh?</b>

16:36.047 --> 16:39.127
<b>My friend, I think he needs
a little time right now.</b>

16:39.167 --> 16:40.637
<b>Is that all right?</b>

16:43.047 --> 16:44.217
<b>[RAM]
I'm begging you.</b>

16:44.257 --> 16:45.887
<b>Tell me everything.</b>

16:45.927 --> 16:47.217
<b>[SUBARU]
This is all disturbingly</b>

16:47.267 --> 16:48.927
<b>identical to my dream.</b>

16:48.977 --> 16:51.307
<b>If there's one single problem--</b>

16:51.347 --> 16:52.767
<b>OK, Subaru.</b>

16:52.807 --> 16:54.517
<b>Stay and rest, all right?</b>

16:57.227 --> 16:58.817
<b>[SUBARU]
It's not what they all do,</b>

16:58.857 --> 17:00.897
<b>but what I decide
to do differently.</b>

17:00.947 --> 17:03.277
<b>Master, your face is
looking super scary!</b>

17:03.317 --> 17:05.867
<b>If something's troubling you,
you can always talk to me.</b>

17:05.907 --> 17:08.157
<b>Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!</b>

17:08.197 --> 17:09.617
<b>What'd you do that for,
brat number two?</b>

17:09.657 --> 17:11.247
<b>Well, I don't want
Emilia and Beatrice</b>

17:11.287 --> 17:13.837
<b>getting mad at me for not
keeping you on a leash, 'k?</b>

17:13.877 --> 17:15.167
<b>[growls]</b>

17:15.207 --> 17:16.627
<b>Man, you piss me off!</b>

17:16.667 --> 17:19.207
<b>Master, you've got
to say something to her.</b>

17:19.257 --> 17:20.217
<b>Huh?</b>

17:20.257 --> 17:21.257
<b>Nice save.</b>

17:21.297 --> 17:22.887
<b>- Thanks, Meili.
- [groans]</b>

17:22.927 --> 17:26.217
<b>It's probably sort of weird
to be thanking an assassin.</b>

17:26.257 --> 17:27.597
<b>Master, you jerk!</b>

17:27.637 --> 17:28.967
<b>[muffled sobbing]</b>

17:29.017 --> 17:31.347
<b>You really don't
remember anything at all,</b>

17:31.387 --> 17:33.017
<b>do you, Subaru?</b>

17:33.057 --> 17:34.857
<b>[SUBARU]
Unfortunately, no.</b>

17:34.897 --> 17:37.777
<b>Did I, like, make some
important promise or something?</b>

17:37.817 --> 17:39.897
<b>If I did, how the hell
could yesterday's me</b>

17:39.937 --> 17:41.527
<b>have been careless
enough to get himself</b>

17:41.567 --> 17:42.857
<b>into this whole mess, huh?</b>

17:42.907 --> 17:44.197
<b>Heh.</b>

17:44.237 --> 17:46.697
<b>Yeah, yesterday's you
was indeed careless.</b>

17:46.737 --> 17:48.787
<b>I fully agree with you there.</b>

17:53.247 --> 17:54.997
<b>[SUBARU]
Right then.</b>

17:55.037 --> 17:56.997
<b>I just need to find out why
I woke up from the dream</b>

17:57.047 --> 17:59.837
<b>and what happened
after this point.</b>

18:03.377 --> 18:05.847
<b>It goes on forever.</b>

18:05.887 --> 18:07.467
<b>[gasps]</b>

18:10.427 --> 18:14.137
<b>There's no point in fearing a
future that isn't set in stone.</b>

18:14.187 --> 18:15.397
<b>That's it.</b>

18:15.437 --> 18:18.357
<b>I'll tell them about
my prophetic dream.</b>

18:18.397 --> 18:20.857
<b>If I can figure out
exactly how it works,</b>

18:20.897 --> 18:22.317
<b>I know it'll be
a powerful asset.</b>

18:22.357 --> 18:23.697
<b>That's why--</b>

18:23.737 --> 18:24.817
<b>[MEILI]
I'm worried about keeping</b>

18:24.857 --> 18:25.947
<b>Natsuki with us
any longer.</b>

18:25.987 --> 18:27.697
<b>Isn't it too dangerous?</b>

18:27.737 --> 18:30.237
<b>[RAM] I'm assuming you aren't
concerned about Barusu's safety</b>

18:30.287 --> 18:31.577
<b>so much as you're
concerned that he'll</b>

18:31.617 --> 18:32.997
<b>slow us down in this state?</b>

18:33.037 --> 18:34.497
<b>If so, I agree.</b>

18:34.537 --> 18:36.117
<b>[EMILIA] Ram,
even you're talking</b>

18:36.167 --> 18:37.877
<b>about Subaru that way now?</b>

18:37.917 --> 18:39.747
<b>[RAM] I was only stating
the objective truth.</b>

18:39.797 --> 18:41.337
<b>[JULIUS]
Miss Emilia,</b>

18:41.377 --> 18:43.547
<b>they're simply thinking about
the success of the mission</b>

18:43.587 --> 18:45.377
<b>and pointing out that there
are too many uncertainties</b>

18:45.427 --> 18:48.257
<b>involved in relying
on him right now.</b>

18:48.297 --> 18:49.887
<b>[BEATRICE]
When you put it like that,</b>

18:49.927 --> 18:52.467
<b>it sounds like you agree
with that spirit, I suppose.</b>

18:52.517 --> 18:54.137
<b>[JULIUS]
Well, that's--</b>

18:54.177 --> 18:57.187
<b>I had to hear all that right
after I decided to tell them?</b>

18:57.227 --> 18:58.397
<b>Damn it!</b>

18:58.437 --> 19:01.027
<b>[panting]</b>

19:03.107 --> 19:04.777
<b>The way they're
talking about me,</b>

19:04.817 --> 19:07.777
<b>I don't know if they'd even
believe me about the dream.</b>

19:07.817 --> 19:09.327
<b>[yells]</b>

19:09.367 --> 19:10.697
<b>[crunch]</b>

19:11.447 --> 19:13.037
<b>[yelling]</b>

19:13.077 --> 19:14.907
<b>[MEILI] I'm worried about
keeping Natsuki with us</b>

19:14.957 --> 19:15.957
<b>any longer.</b>

19:15.997 --> 19:17.327
<b>Isn't it too dangerous?</b>

19:17.367 --> 19:18.787
<b>[RAM]
I agree.</b>

19:18.837 --> 19:20.497
<b>[EMILIA] You're talking
about Subaru that way?</b>

19:21.917 --> 19:25.007
<b>[JULIUS] Too many uncertainties
involved in relying on him.</b>

19:25.047 --> 19:28.887
<b>[EMILIA] Our memories are what
make us everything we are.</b>

19:31.057 --> 19:34.177
<b>You're still Subaru, after all.</b>

19:34.217 --> 19:36.137
<b>[SUBARU]
Really?</b>

19:36.177 --> 19:37.847
<b>[crunch]</b>

19:38.557 --> 19:39.807
<b>Who do you think you are?</b>

19:39.857 --> 19:41.437
<b>[gasps]</b>

19:42.187 --> 19:44.647
<b>[yelling]</b>

19:45.027 --> 19:46.397
<b>[coughing]</b>

19:46.437 --> 19:48.357
<b>[EMILIA]
Subaru, what's wrong?</b>

19:48.397 --> 19:49.657
<b>Take it easy.</b>

19:50.827 --> 19:52.077
<b>[screams]</b>

19:53.117 --> 19:54.867
<b>[BEATRICE] Subaru,
calm down, I suppose.</b>

19:54.907 --> 19:56.037
<b>Beatrice!</b>

19:56.077 --> 19:57.367
<b>Ah!</b>

19:57.407 --> 20:01.127
<b>[screaming]</b>

20:08.837 --> 20:13.217
<b>[sobbing]</b>

20:13.257 --> 20:17.477
<b>[laughing]</b>

20:20.227 --> 20:21.727
<b>[REID]
Hey, kid.</b>

20:21.767 --> 20:23.767
<b>What in the hell do you
think you're doing up here</b>

20:23.817 --> 20:25.977
<b>so early in the morning, huh?</b>

20:27.107 --> 20:28.197
<b>Whoa, whoa, whoa.</b>

20:28.237 --> 20:29.277
<b>Come on, bro.</b>

20:29.317 --> 20:30.867
<b>You're not crying, are ya?</b>

20:30.907 --> 20:33.117
<b>Did you get in a fight with
your buddies downstairs</b>

20:33.157 --> 20:34.537
<b>or something, kid?</b>

20:34.577 --> 20:37.117
<b>You crying because you
lost an argument or what?</b>

20:37.157 --> 20:38.827
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:39.997 --> 20:41.827
<b>[groaning]</b>

20:41.877 --> 20:43.207
<b>[REID] The hell makes
you think you can</b>

20:43.247 --> 20:45.087
<b>just bring your problems here?</b>

20:45.127 --> 20:48.217
<b>And your tiny little legs
ran up to me on top of it.</b>

20:48.257 --> 20:50.087
<b>What kind of joke is that, huh?</b>

20:50.127 --> 20:52.047
<b>You're the one who chose
the people you're stuck</b>

20:52.097 --> 20:53.637
<b>hanging out with in here.</b>

20:53.677 --> 20:56.057
<b>Or is it that you
just got a death wish?</b>

20:56.097 --> 20:57.427
<b>Beat it, loser.</b>

21:00.767 --> 21:03.517
<b>[screams]</b>

21:03.937 --> 21:07.897
<b>[crunching]</b>

21:08.277 --> 21:10.147
<b>[sobbing]</b>

21:10.197 --> 21:11.737
<b>No.
It hurts.</b>

21:11.777 --> 21:12.737
<b>It hurts.</b>

21:12.777 --> 21:13.737
<b>It hurts.</b>

21:13.777 --> 21:15.027
<b>It hurts so much.</b>

21:15.077 --> 21:17.197
<b>[sobbing]</b>

21:17.237 --> 21:21.867
<b>It was only a few hours ago
I was with my dad and my mom,</b>

21:21.917 --> 21:23.327
<b>and then--</b>

21:25.667 --> 21:27.297
<b>[MOM]
Take care of yourself.</b>

21:29.667 --> 21:32.757
<b>[SUBARU] I didn't feel
like washing the mug,</b>

21:32.797 --> 21:36.057
<b>so I left without
saying a word to my mom.</b>

21:37.177 --> 21:40.267
<b>I should have told her
that I'd be back soon.</b>

21:40.307 --> 21:42.097
<b>I'm such a damn screwup.</b>

21:42.137 --> 21:44.607
<b>I never got to repay
her for everything.</b>

21:44.647 --> 21:46.477
<b>Couldn't even do some dishes.</b>

21:46.517 --> 21:48.477
<b>I'll die without--</b>

21:48.527 --> 21:50.067
<b>[laughter]</b>

21:50.817 --> 21:52.277
<b>Don't laugh.</b>

21:52.317 --> 21:53.817
<b>Stop laughing at me.</b>

21:53.857 --> 21:55.237
<b>Don't you dare laugh at me!</b>

21:55.277 --> 21:56.237
<b>[laughter]</b>

21:56.277 --> 21:57.287
<b>Don't laugh!</b>

21:57.327 --> 21:58.407
<b>Stop it!</b>

21:58.447 --> 22:00.657
<b>I'm gonna die, but I won't--</b>

22:00.697 --> 22:03.457
<b>I won't let myself
be killed by you!</b>

22:03.497 --> 22:04.707
<b>You can't!</b>

22:04.747 --> 22:06.787
<b>I refuse to let
you take my life!</b>

22:06.837 --> 22:08.127
<b>I'm too tired.
No, I'm gonna die.</b>

22:08.167 --> 22:09.087
<b>No way!</b>

22:09.127 --> 22:10.087
<b>I'm not dying!</b>

22:10.127 --> 22:11.087
<b>I'm dead!</b>

22:11.127 --> 22:12.087
<b>I'm so dead!</b>

22:12.127 --> 22:13.467
<b>I'll die!</b>

22:13.507 --> 22:16.757
<b>I'll come back here,
but I will never let you--</b>

22:16.797 --> 22:17.807
<b>I love you.</b>

22:17.847 --> 22:19.517
<b>[gasps]</b>

22:23.227 --> 22:25.227
<b>No, stop.</b>

22:25.267 --> 22:29.607
<b>[screaming]</b>

22:32.647 --> 22:36.357
<b>Just hurry and kill me already.</b>

22:36.407 --> 22:37.697
<b>[EMILIA]
Subaru!</b>

22:37.737 --> 22:40.657
<b>[sobbing weakly]</b>

22:45.207 --> 22:46.457
<b>[EMILIA]
Subaru?</b>

22:47.667 --> 22:49.877
<b>[groaning softly]</b>

22:51.587 --> 22:53.547
<b>Rem deserves much better.</b>

22:55.297 --> 22:58.097
<b>Subaru, just stay in here
and relax, all right?</b>

22:58.137 --> 23:01.307
<b>Betty will find a way
to remedy this, I suppose.</b>

23:01.347 --> 23:04.477
<b>I won't sit by and allow you
to just cower here all alone.</b>

23:04.517 --> 23:07.687
<b>[footsteps]</b>

23:08.437 --> 23:11.777
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

23:11.817 --> 23:15.737
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:15.777 --> 23:17.567
<b>It's happened twice.</b>

23:17.607 --> 23:20.077
<b>I've died twice now.</b>

23:20.117 --> 23:23.787
<b>The moment I died after that
fall, I went back to that room</b>

23:23.827 --> 23:28.037
<b>and it repeated again,
that same span of time.</b>

23:29.207 --> 23:31.337
<b>It's no prophetic dream.</b>

23:31.377 --> 23:34.087
<b>It's Return by Death.</b>

23:34.127 --> 23:37.717
<b>So I'll just get
someone to kill me.</b>

23:37.757 --> 23:42.597
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:42.637 --> 23:44.057
<b>[gasps]</b>

23:44.097 --> 23:50.147
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:57.197 --> 23:58.357
<b>Master.</b>

23:58.407 --> 23:59.907
<b>WHO ARE YOU?</b>
